# Despark: "Exile target permanent with mana value 4 or greater." The caster's own Hero of Bladehold (mana value 4) is a
# legal target (CR 115.1: "target permanent", whoever controls it): a Swamp's {B} and a Black Lotus's three {W} pay its
# {2}{W}{W}, and then a Mox Pearl's {W} and a Mox Jet's {B} pay Despark and exile it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Hero of Bladehold
Despark
Mox Jet
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Hero of Bladehold.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Hero of Bladehold.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Despark.Cast(Hero of Bladehold)
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Exile = Hero of Bladehold
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Mox Pearl; Mox Jet
Bot1.Graveyard = Despark; Black Lotus
